f4fd\">구름은 언젠가 지나간다는걸 자꾸 까먹어요. 구름 아래에 있을 때는 구름 밖에 안보이잖아요. 그래서 다음에는 까먹지 않으려구요. </span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-1ca697dc-bac3-4771-9d8c-2b420db5b410\"><span style=\"color:#0f0f0f;\" class=\"se-fs-fs16 se-ff-system  se-style-unset \" id=\"SE-308c66eb-1303-473b-80c0-de813476709d\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-002e53e1-2d7a-4819-b826-38c7db9a2f4f\"><span style=\"color:#0f0f0f;\" class=\"se-fs-fs16 se-ff-system  se-style-unset \" id=\"SE-b2c1cda0-f3b4-41d5-8796-2bbd6aabe6bc\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-57729e14-91eb-4086-9489-a38ae4aa2848\"><span style=\"color:#0f0f0f;\" class=\"se-fs-fs16 se-ff-system  se-style-unset \" id=\"SE-397dfc65-29e3-4a29-9fdd-fcc946a42a9a\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-a3d678bc-f7ae-49ab-9273-bde207f82b94\"><span style=\"color:#0f0f0f;background-color:#ffffff;\" class=\"se-fs-fs16 se-ff-system  se-style-unset \" id=\"SE-3eb5423d-b1e7-4e22-86ef-3b85ca235a58\">여러분도 저처럼 까먹지 마시라고 써봅니다 ㅎㅎ</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT -->\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>    </div>\n</div>\n",
